==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|head=[[latter|Latter]]-[[day]] [[saint|Saint]]|-}}

# Of, or pertaining to, any church, or person, identifying with the Latter-Day Saint movement started by {{w|Joseph Smith, Jr.|Joseph Smith}} in the 19th century, the largest denomination of which is the [[Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints]].

